      "content": "i mean it's just some blisters and it's not like my whole body hurts, i'm not dizzy or anything. i'm just really nervous about the cost of the er and the wait times. i feel like i can handle this if i just find something to soothe it. can you just tell me what i should do right now to calm the skin down? like, is there any cream or even just some aloe or honey that is definitely safe to use so i can just sleep it off tonight?",
